  "notes": "The flyer lists 25 objectives under 8 headings mapped to SEH5E Parts 1 to 5, with no numbers. IDs LO01 to LO25 follow flyer order and are Halcyon's, not INCOSE's. Every objective is paraphrased. The flyer names no objective for measurement on its own; measurement (M7) is mapped under the monitoring and control objective (LO07). Quality assurance (M8) maps to LO05 because the flyer lists it under business and enterprise integration. Interfaces (LO22) has no dedicated task code; mapped to T4 and T8 as the closest. Systems of systems (LO24) has no dedicated code; mapped to X4. The flyer gives objective titles only, so the named sub concepts in each match list come from the SEH5E process and chapter structure, not from the flyer."
